From f86593378021e2019e9bccf71f3cedcabbb08978 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jernej Skrabec <jernej.skrabec@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 18 Jul 2026 13:29:01 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 223/273] drm/sun4i: Add register shadow helper

Display Engine registers are unsafe to read and later hardware revisions
update them through an RCQ DMA engine. Keep a software shadow for each
register region so callers can always express complete writes.

For engines without hardware RCQ, copy the shadowed regions to MMIO
at the end of the atomic commit. This establishes the same write-only
interface for both update mechanisms.

Signed-off-by: Jernej Skrabec <jernej.skrabec@gmail.com>
